WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:07.170
Hi my name is Nick Hughes Committee
Services Manager at Thanet District

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:11.129
Council. The council has a helpful and
friendly Democratic Services team, part

00:00:11.129 --> 00:00:14.490
of whose job is to help and support all
councillors and answer any queries they

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.940
may have. We provide a comprehensive
member's induction for all of our

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.300
councillors covering all aspects of
being a councillor - to get you off to the

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.110
best possible start in your role. In
addition we also provide member training

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:27.870
throughout your time as a councillor,
which is tailored to your individual

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:31.800
needs. This covers both how the council
works and soft skills such as speed

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.719
reading assertiveness and ICT skills.

